Duvo includes or builds on the following projects. Full license texts are in docs/licenses/.

- Apollo / Sunshine (GPL-3.0): the Windows host is a patch series over Apollo (base commit adc5c5a0,
  https://github.com/ClassicOldSong/Apollo), itself a fork of LizardByte/Sunshine. Source for the host:
  that repository plus tools/host/patches/duvo/ in this one.
- moonlight-common-c (GPL-3.0), https://github.com/moonlight-stream/moonlight-common-c (git submodule).
- OpenSSL (Apache-2.0) and Opus (BSD-3-Clause), prebuilt for Android under android/app/src/main/cpp/third_party.
- scrcpy (Apache-2.0) and adb (Android platform-tools, Apache-2.0): used by reverse mode; not bundled in the
  repository, fetched from their official releases by the installer.
- ViGEmBus (BSD-3-Clause, nefarius) and nefcon (BSD-3-Clause): virtual gamepad driver and installer helper.
- SudoVDA (virtual display driver, distributed with Apollo): used by Monitor mode; installed from Apollo's release.
- IBM Plex fonts (SIL OFL 1.1).
